OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump to meet Irish
OL,4,Apresident on two day visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump will meet
OL,7,FIrish President Catherine Connolly as
OL,8,Fpart of a two day visit to the Republic
OL,9,Fof Ireland next week.
OL,11,FThe long planned visit will see Trump
OL,12,Fjetting in on the Air Force One into
OL,13,FDublin on 12 September.
OL,15,FHe will meet Connolly and hold a
OL,16,Fbilateral meeting with the Taoiseach
OL,17,F(Irish prime minister) Micheal Martin
OL,18,Fbefore travelling to his golf course in
OL,19,FDoonbeg, County Clare.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
