OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump to meet Irish
OL,4,Apresident on two day visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FConnolly has been critical of the US
OL,7,Fpreviously over its stance on Gaza but
OL,8,Fsaid she would "meet and greet" the US
OL,9,Fpresident if he visited Ireland.
